flowchart TD
  A[Enter reg + session code] --> B[Resolve student + session]

  B -->|session found| C[Enroll on list if needed]
  C --> D[StudentCheckInProgressScreen]
  D --> E[GPS + validation]
  E --> F[submitStudentCheckInWithOfflineSupport]
  F -->|online| G[check_in_attempts → server reconciles]
  F -->|offline| H[PendingCheckInQueue]

  B -->|session not found| I[Unknown code dialog]
  I -->|code is wrong| A
  I -->|code matches lecturer| J[OfflineQueueLocationScreen]
  J --> K[Capture GPS + capturedAt intent time]
  K --> L[PendingSessionCodeQueue]
  L --> M[Saved on device · pending list]

  M --> N[Sync when online / app resume]
  N --> O[PendingSessionCodeSync]
  O --> P{Resolve session at capturedAt?}
  P -->|not yet| Q[Stay queued up to 7 days]
  Q --> N
  P -->|found| R{Roster + course OK?}
  R -->|no| S[needsRegistration · student joins list]
  S --> N
  R -->|yes| T{Time + GPS valid at capture?}
  T -->|fail| U[invalidOrExpired · dropped after retention]
  T -->|pass| F

  F -->|Path B success| V[Remove from queue · present on roll]
